---
title: ElectionTransaction healthy-ring sequence
config:
  theme: forest
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Akka Scheduler
    participant R1 as Replica 1 (crashed coordinator)
    participant R2 as Replica 2
    participant R3 as Replica 3
    participant R4 as Replica 4

    Note over R2,R4: Logical ring: R2 -> R3 -> R4 -> R2

    rect rgba(255, 200, 0, 0.25)
        Note over R1: R1 crashes and sends no more heartbeats
        S ->> R3: WatchdogExpiredMsg(version)
        Note right of R3: Heartbeat FSM enters ELECTION_REQUESTED
        Note right of R3: Create ElectionTransaction<br/>Candidate R3=pair(2,4)
    end

    rect rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.20)
        R3 ->> R4: ElectionMsg(round=1, {R3=pair(2,4)})
        R3 ->> S: schedule ElectionAckTimeout
        Note right of R3: WAITING_FOR_ACK

        Note right of R4: Create local ElectionTransaction<br/>Add candidate R4=pair(2,5)
        R4 ->> R3: ElectionAckMsg()
        R4 ->> R2: ElectionMsg(round=1, {R3=pair(2,4), R4=pair(2,5)})
        R4 ->> S: schedule ElectionAckTimeout
        Note right of R4: WAITING_FOR_ACK

        Note right of R3: Cancel timeout<br/>WAITING_FOR_TOKEN

        Note right of R2: Create local ElectionTransaction<br/>Add candidate R2=pair(2,3)
        R2 ->> R4: ElectionAckMsg()
        R2 ->> R3: ElectionMsg(round=1, {R2=pair(2,3), R3=pair(2,4), R4=pair(2,5)})
        R2 ->> S: schedule ElectionAckTimeout
        Note right of R2: WAITING_FOR_ACK

        Note right of R4: Cancel timeout<br/>WAITING_FOR_TOKEN

        R3 ->> R2: ElectionAckMsg()
        Note right of R3: Candidate already present<br/>Local replica is not winner
        R3 ->> R4: ElectionMsg(round=1, {R2=pair(2,3), R3=pair(2,4), R4=pair(2,5)})
        R3 ->> S: schedule ElectionAckTimeout
        Note right of R3: WAITING_FOR_ACK

        Note right of R2: Cancel timeout<br/>WAITING_FOR_TOKEN

        R4 ->> R3: ElectionAckMsg()
        Note right of R4: Candidate already present<br/>Token completed the ring
        Note right of R4: R4 has newest pair(2,5)<br/>State = ELECTED
        Note right of R3: Cancel timeout<br/>WAITING_FOR_TOKEN
    end

    rect rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.20)
        Note right of R4: Resolve incomplete old update, if any<br/>Freeze authoritative history<br/>Install coordinator R4 with new epoch 3
        R4 ->> R2: SynchronizationMsg(coordinator=R4, epoch=3, history)
        R4 ->> R3: SynchronizationMsg(coordinator=R4, epoch=3, history)
        Note right of R4: SYNCHRONIZING

        Note right of R2: Apply missing updates in order<br/>Install R4 and epoch 3<br/>DONE
        Note right of R3: Apply missing updates in order<br/>Install R4 and epoch 3<br/>DONE

        %% Proposed acknowledgements make synchronization completion observable
        %% to the new coordinator before it resumes processing writes.
        R2 ->> R4: SynchronizationAckMsg(epoch=3)
        R3 ->> R4: SynchronizationAckMsg(epoch=3)

        Note right of R4: Synchronization completed<br/>DONE<br/>Start heartbeat and resume writes
    end
